Author: CelebiHunter contributors

Version:
    Major: 1
    Minor: 0
    Revision: 0

Targets:
    - 0x00172800

Title: Reset

Summary: Automated shiny reset hunt for English Crystal VC

Description: |
  Automates the title screen, Continue, shrine event, encounter check, and non-shiny reset.
  Crystal's original RNG determines every encounter. No target Advance or DV combination is selected.
  Stops on a verified shiny Celebi or when the user presses B. Creates no SD log.
  Supports Old 3DS/2DS at 268 MHz and New 3DS/2DS at 268 or 804 MHz.

Compatibility: Any
MemorySize: 5MiB
